<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>在上述代码中，定义了局部变量cfg。由于这是一个结构体，他可能出于提升程序运行效率的目的，将&amp;cfg传给新创建的任务sensor，用作该任务的参数。</p>
<p>这位同学很疑问：任务参数不能这么传吗？出现问题的原因是什么？</p>
<h2 id="任务参数的传递过程" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#任务参数的传递过程"><span>任务参数的传递过程</span></a></h2>
<p>要分析这个问题，我们得先看一下任务参数到底是怎么传递的。rt_thread_create()的声明如下：</p>
<div class="language-c line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="c" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code" v-pre=""><code class="language-c"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965">rt_thread_t</span><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665"> rt_thread_create</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">const</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> char</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> *</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">name</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">                             void</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666"> (</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">*</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">entry</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">)(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">void</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> *</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">parameter</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">),</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">                             void</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">       *</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">parameter</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965">                             rt_uint32_t</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A"> stack_size</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965">                             rt_uint8_t</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">  priority</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965">                             rt_uint32_t</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A"> tick</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">);</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>其中，parameter参数用于向任务传递初始运行参数，该参数的类型是void*，表示可以向其传入任意类型的指针。</p>
<p><strong>这位同学可能误以为：RTOS会帮我们把这块内容拷一份过去，再传给任务</strong>。其实完全不是这么回事。<strong>内核做的事情非常简单：只是把传进来的那个指针值，原封不动地交给任务</strong>。</p>
<p><img src="@source/notes/tech/rtos100/task/images/q21/任务参数传递过程.jpg" alt="任务参数传递过程"></p>
<p>这就导致sensor任务开始运行的时候，实际拿到的只是指针值。</p>
<h2 id="为什么不能传局部变量指针" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#为什么不能传局部变量指针"><span>为什么不能传局部变量指针</span></a></h2>
<p>了解了参数传递的过程，再来看前面那段代码，问题就很明显了。</p>
<p>由于cfg这个变量是在sensor_init()函数里定义的局部变量，该变量被分配到当前栈上。如果将&amp;cfg传给rt_thread_create()，RTOS实际是将这个地址值（栈内的地址）传递给sensor任务。<strong>在sensor任务自己的栈中，实际上并没有cfg这个变量，而仅有该变量的指针</strong>。</p>
<p><img src="@source/notes/tech/rtos100/task/images/q21/局部变量栈位置与引用关系.jpg" alt="局部变量栈位置与引用关系"></p>
<p>那么，问题就来了：<strong>当sensor_init()函数一返回，cfg变量在原来栈上占用的那段栈帧会被释放掉，用来放置新的局部变量、返回地址和保存的寄存器</strong>。</p>
<p><img src="@source/notes/tech/rtos100/task/images/q21/cfg被覆盖过程.jpg" alt="cfg被覆盖过程"></p>
<p>更要命的是，sensor任务并不一定是调用rt_thread_startup()后就立即运行，而是可能在就绪队列中等待。具体什么时候开始执行，取决于调度器。在这段时间里，main()可能又调了好几个函数，这就导致cfg所处的位置可能被其他函数或任务改写。</p>
<p>等sensor任务开始运行，再通过获得的任务参数指针去访问cfg那块区域时，得到的数据早已不是原来的数据。</p>
<h2 id="正确的做法" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#正确的做法"><span>正确的做法</span></a></h2>
<p>在进行以上分析之后，我们可以知道：<strong>问题并不在于能否向任务传递局部变量的指针，而在于能否保证任务运行时，该局部变量所在的内存区域不会被释放或覆盖</strong>。</p>
<p>因此，为了将参数传给任务，我们可以采用以下更为安全的选择。</p>
<h3 id="方法一-使用静态变量或全局变量" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#方法一-使用静态变量或全局变量"><span>方法一：使用静态变量或全局变量</span></a></h3>
<p>可以将局部变量改成static变量，或者直接定义成全局变量。</p>
<div class="language-c line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="c" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code" v-pre=""><code class="language-c"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">void</span><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665"> sensor_init</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">void</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">    /* 静态变量，生命周期覆盖整个程序 */</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">    static</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676"> struct</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE"> sensor_cfg cfg</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">    cfg</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">.</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">rate</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666"> =</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91"> 100</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">    cfg</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">.</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">channel</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666"> =</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91"> 3</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#998418;--shiki-dark:#B8A965">    rt_thread_t</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE"> tid </span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665"> rt_thread_create</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B56959;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D">sensor</span><span style="--shiki-light:#B5695977;--shiki-dark:#C98A7D77">"</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">                        sensor_thread_entry</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">                        &#x26;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">cfg</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91"> 1024</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91"> 10</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">,</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91"> 10</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">);</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665">    rt_thread_startup</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">tid</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">);</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">}</span></span></code></pre>
<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>此时，cfg变量不再放在栈上，而是放在全局数据段(.bss)里。这样一来，<strong>它的生命周期和整个程序一样长</strong>，sensor任务任何时候都能安全读写。</p>
<p>不过，这种方法的缺点也明显：如果多次调用sensor_init()创建多个任务，则所有任务会共享同一个cfg，后面的赋值会覆盖前面的。而且如果sensor任务只是在初始化时使用一次cfg，之后cfg仍然会一直占用着内存。</p>
<h3 id="方法二-从堆中动态分配" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#方法二-从堆中动态分配"><span>方法二：从堆中动态分配</span></a></h3>
<p>如果需要多次调用sensor_init()创建多个任务，需要为每个任务独立配置cfg变量。此时，可以从堆中申请一块内存，然后把这块内存的地址传给任务。</p>
<div class="language-c line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="c" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code" v-pre=""><code class="language-c"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">void</span><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665"> sensor_init</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">void</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">)</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">{</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">    struct</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE"> sensor_cfg </span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">*</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE">cfg </span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#59873A;--shiki-dark:#80A665"> rt_malloc</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">sizeof</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">(</span><span style="--shiki-light:#AB5959;--shiki-dark:#CB7676">struct</span><span style="--shiki-light:#393A34;--shiki-dark:#DBD7CAEE"> sensor_cfg</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">));</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">    cfg</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">-></span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">rate</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666"> =</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91"> 100</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">;</span></span>
<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">    cfg</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">-></span><span style="--shiki-light:#B07D48;--shiki-dark:#BD976A">channel</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666"> =</span><span style="--shiki-light:#2F798A;--shiki-dark:#4C9A91"> 3</span><span style="--shiki-light:#999999;--shiki-dark:#666666">;</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
